WEBVTT

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:35.590
Tell me the truth!

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:40.170
I'm leaving.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:42.750
Wait! I'm not done talk--

00:01:43.170 --> 00:01:44.280
Let go!

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:45.150
NO!

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:45.890
Hey!

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:55.590
Mr. Godai.

00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:57.060
Yagami.

00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:00.140
Stop right there.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:02.370
Ms. Kamiogi!

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:05.400
I-It's not what you think.

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.550
M-Manager.

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.230
Oh, jeez.

00:02:31.850 --> 00:02:33.640
Just because of that incident

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:36.580
Ms. Kamiogi's been
watching me like a hawk.

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:40.430
Your problem is that widow.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:47.050
Yeah. She's got him
wrapped around her finger.

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:50.320
Very peculiar, I'd say.

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:53.180
They're totally an item,
don't you think?

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:58.410
You have no proof.

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:01.260
But what are you
gonna do, Yagami?

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:04.050
He's only student-teaching
until day after tomorrow.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:05.700
I know.

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:06.800
Are you gonna give up?

00:03:06.880 --> 00:03:08.360
No way!

00:03:10.110 --> 00:03:12.200
You haven't gotten
any cleaning done!

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.320
I'm not giving up!

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:27.890
She's an old maid.
I'm so much more attractive.

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:36.450
Hmm... She seemed to know
Ms. Kamiogi really well...

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:40.910
and it didn't seem like her
first time at this school.

00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:44.170
--Goodbye, Ms. Kamiyogi!
--Goodbye.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:50.510
--Bye!
--Goodbye.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:04:01.790
"The widow"? You mean
Kyoko Otonashi?

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.550
Do you know her?

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:06.830
Yes. She's our alumna.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.670
She was my student.

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:17.070
She married one of our former
teachers. Mr. Otonashi.

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:18.300
Her teacher?

00:04:19.960 --> 00:04:21.290
She was head over heels.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:24.150
So she's like me.

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:28.610
She didn't go
to your extreme.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:38.300
What's taking
Yagami so long?

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:41.230
She's probably chasing
around Mr. Godai.

00:04:42.430 --> 00:04:44.840
But it's Saturday,
for cryin' out loud.

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:47.300
Yagami seemed so serious.

00:04:55.090 --> 00:04:56.110
I see.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.280
That widow fell in love
with a teacher, too.

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:05.600
So she's in no position to poo-poo
my relationship with Mr. Godai.

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:10.530
Yagami!
What're you doing?

00:05:10.630 --> 00:05:13.190
We're waiting for you, Yagami!

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:16.110
Hey! My shoes!

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:21.870
All right.
I'm going to talk to her.

00:05:30.550 --> 00:05:31.880
Oh, my gosh!

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:34.460
This is nothing.

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:36.870
Really? I can't believe it.

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:39.110
But men--

00:05:39.190 --> 00:05:41.310
You're SO naive!

00:05:41.970 --> 00:05:46.980
The express will be passing through.
Please step behind the line.

00:05:57.810 --> 00:05:59.070
Mr. Godai!

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:00.940
Y-Yagami!

00:06:03.360 --> 00:06:07.300
Can I go visit you at the
boarding house tomorrow?

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:10.180
Huh? Uh...um...

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:15.420
Actually, my grandma's dying...

00:06:16.130 --> 00:06:19.990
Don't get so defensive.

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:23.120
They're coming
with me, too.

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.840
Please? It's okay
if we all go, right?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.300
Well... it's not that I--

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:34.110
Okay. It's a promise.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.000
A pinky promise!

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:51.230
Welcome back, Godai.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:52.230
Hello.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.120
Monday's your last day
of student-teaching...

00:06:55.480 --> 00:06:56.430
isn't it?

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:58.000
Uh-huh.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:02.800
Yagami isn't letting you go?

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:07.350
S-She doesn't mean
anything to me.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:10.020
I-I'm sorry.

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.480
I didn't mean to--

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:15.210
It's just that she knows
where you live, you know.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.380
That's right...

00:07:19.860 --> 00:07:22.300
and she said she'll
come over tomorrow.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:37.870
I guess there's no guarantee...

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:41.410
that she'll say goodbye as soon
as student-teaching is over.

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:50.880
Hello!!

00:07:57.130 --> 00:07:58.800
H-Hello.

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:00.160
We're here to see you.

00:08:02.570 --> 00:08:03.170
Oh.

00:08:03.710 --> 00:08:05.130
Nice to see you again.

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:07.120
Hi.

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:10.070
Godai.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:17.150
You should have told me
they were coming.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.220
I could have
prepared something.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:21.810
But--

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:24.280
They're like
a married couple.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:25.730
We were right.

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:27.880
How lovey-dovey.

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:31.290
Don't worry, Manager.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:34.950
Mr. Godai is a bachelor..

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:39.800
I figured he wouldn't have
anything, so I went shopping.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:41.590
How nice.

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:45.420
Let's go, Mr. Godai.

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:46.600
See you.

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:51.760
What an aggressive girl.

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:05.220
It's me, Yotsuya. Welcome.

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:06.690
Please.

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.190
Come on in.

00:09:09.970 --> 00:09:12.140
Snake Man, you look so cool!

00:09:12.550 --> 00:09:14.540
Is it a new suit?

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:18.200
Yes. My late grandma told me
in a dream last night...

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:20.800
to welcome you girls
in a white suit.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:23.470
What a dirty kitchen.

00:09:45.050 --> 00:09:46.940
I didn't have enough
matching cups.

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:48.870
You don't mind this one
do you, Godai?

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:49.920
N-No.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.020
Is she tying
to provoke me?

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:02.750
You silly Snake Man!

00:10:05.690 --> 00:10:08.810
Yagami, what's all that?

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:15.350
--Oops! Oh, no!
--Quick! Wipe it!

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:20.770
Rag! A rag!

00:10:23.150 --> 00:10:24.100
Thank you.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:29.570
--Wipe it up! Hurry!
--What're you doing? !

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:42.280
--Good-bye.
--Thanks for having us.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.580
Bye!

00:10:44.060 --> 00:10:46.300
Okay. Bye!

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.170
I shall miss you!

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:18.940
I'm back, Soichiro!

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:22.140
You're WHAT?!
SLEEPING OVER?!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:23.850
No!

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:25.910
No! No! No! No! No!

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:27.050
NO!!

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:31.850
But I told my parents that I'm
sleeping over at a friend's place.

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:33.560
I can't go home now.

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:34.550
Go home!

00:11:34.640 --> 00:11:35.150
No!

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:36.420
I'll throw you out!

00:11:37.530 --> 00:11:39.470
Go ahead. Why don't you?!

00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:45.610
Ooh! This is
getting interesting.

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:46.690
Yeah.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:49.530
If you keep pulling
stunts like this...

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:51.380
people are gonna
spread rumors.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:52.830
You touched my breast.

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:54.810
Why you--!

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:58.900
"Breast"? How scandalous.

00:11:59.130 --> 00:12:00.650
You touched me in
the storage room.

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:02.410
That was...

00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:04.650
Godai's not
denying it.

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:06.280
...an accident!!
That was an accident!

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:08.190
Besides, you tricked me!

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:09.900
I wonder.

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:13.400
Godai's pretty horny,
you know.

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:15.470
He probably did touch her.

00:12:21.520 --> 00:12:23.280
Butt out!!

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:24.300
Um--

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:26.170
M-Manager.

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:29.250
Maybe you shouldn't
yell at her like that.

00:12:29.420 --> 00:12:31.940
I can't be so nice
to her anymore.

00:12:32.290 --> 00:12:33.890
It's time to tell it
to her straight.

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:37.490
Listen, Yagami.

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:40.720
You need to behave like
a high-school student.

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:48.580
You touched me.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:50.640
H-Hey.

00:12:51.510 --> 00:12:52.930
You touched my breast!

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:54.430
You don't have to cry.

00:12:55.410 --> 00:12:57.850
No one would marry me now!

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.670
Y-Yagami.

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:02.440
Miss Yagami...

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.620
She's got chutzpa.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:18.860
What're you doing?

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:21.790
Hey! Put your
clothes back on!

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:24.400
What's going on?!

00:13:35.280 --> 00:13:37.330
Look at me now.

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:41.300
I can't go home like this.

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.560
It's fun to eat
with everybody.

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:06.790
It's so nice of you
to invite me, too.

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:09.250
No one invited you.

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:15.300
Your stir-fried vegetables
are nice and bitter, Yagami.

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:17.550
Oh, look!
An exotic mushroom!

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:20.730
Oops. Is it
burnt cabbage?

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.870
I'm glad you like my cooking.

00:14:24.980 --> 00:14:27.530
I'll make stewed beef
and potatoes for breakfast.

00:14:27.900 --> 00:14:29.870
What a nice girl.

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:33.270
Why don't you let her
sleep over, Godai.?

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.200
Don't be ridiculous.

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:38.240
Yagami, you better
go home after you eat.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.040
I'll walk you to
the train station.

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:42.150
I can't go home
dressed like this.

00:14:42.550 --> 00:14:44.150
So change!

00:14:44.490 --> 00:14:45.140
Don't wanna!

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:49.520
What in the world
is this girl thinking?

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:52.680
Even if nothing happens...

00:14:53.100 --> 00:14:56.500
if the world should find
out that she stayed over--

00:14:57.770 --> 00:14:59.860
I'll stall until
the last train goes.

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:01.870
I'm gonna stay over,
no matter what.

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:04.880
if they don't let me stay
in Mr. Godai's room

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:07.530
then I'll stay
in the widow's room.

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:11.200
That'll give me a good excuse
to talk to her about Mr. Godai.

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:15.070
Boy, I'm stuffed.

00:15:15.150 --> 00:15:16.990
Thank you for dinner.

00:15:17.080 --> 00:15:18.200
Thanks.

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:23.720
Hold it. Take this
plate for your dad.

00:15:24.290 --> 00:15:24.910
'Kay.

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:30.770
Well, then.
Shall we help?

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:32.650
Sure.

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:54.580
Go ahead, Godai.
Don't mind us.

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:56.670
W-W-What are you saying?!

00:15:56.770 --> 00:15:58.130
Enough with your gross--

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:01.030
C'mon, young lady.

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:03.320
In you go.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:04.830
W-Wait.

00:16:07.640 --> 00:16:09.230
What? Now?

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:12.030
What? We chatted, we ate--

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.880
All we have left to do
is go to bed.

00:16:14.170 --> 00:16:16.140
B-But--

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:19.270
If you're going home,
you better go now.

00:16:20.650 --> 00:16:24.670
These people aren't
kidding, you know.

00:16:27.190 --> 00:16:28.280
Th-That's right.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:30.650
These people are not normal.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:34.050
W-What's with that look?

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:36.630
They're treating me like a kid.

00:16:45.280 --> 00:16:46.470
Splendid.

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:50.540
How stubborn!

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:52.440
Fine.

00:16:53.150 --> 00:16:54.780
All right. Stay.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:59.180
I'll sleep in
Yotsuya's room.

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.030
No, you can't.

00:17:03.700 --> 00:17:06.780
We're packed like
sardines at our place.

00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:07.990
Not in my room.

00:17:08.300 --> 00:17:09.700
Why you--!

00:17:10.600 --> 00:17:13.830
Fine.
Come to my room.

00:17:15.280 --> 00:17:16.710
M-Manager?

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:18.910
It can't be helped.

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:22.330
I can't believe this widow!

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.510
How indecent!

00:17:24.720 --> 00:17:27.330
She thinks nothing of
inviting a man into her room.

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:33.190
But... Uh... Is it
okay with you that--

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:34.920
It's the only way.

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:37.880
Come on, Yagami.
Get up.

00:17:38.290 --> 00:17:39.760
You're coming to my room.

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:41.880
Shucks.

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:49.890
Why couldn't she just
say so in the beginning?

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:52.140
Good night, then.

00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:57.540
Good night!

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:01.520
Mr. Godai, dream
about me, okay?

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.980
That was easy.

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:20.740
Sorry for the trouble.

00:18:20.870 --> 00:18:21.930
It's okay.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:24.130
It's a good chance for me

00:18:24.220 --> 00:18:28.040
to tell her to stop
pestering Godai.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:34.340
But she doesn't seem like
a girl who'd listen to reason.

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:36.070
Ms. Otonashi!

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:41.420
I actually wanted to talk
to you about something.

00:18:42.200 --> 00:18:44.780
What is it?

00:18:45.240 --> 00:18:48.630
You graduated from
my school, right?

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:52.500
Well... Yes, I did.

00:19:04.040 --> 00:19:05.300
Ms. Otonashi?

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:10.280
Were you that busty when
you were in high school?

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:12.300
No.

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:14.110
I was about your size.

00:19:14.200 --> 00:19:15.050
Really?

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:18.430
Then you must have gotten him
with your charm.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:24.030
I heard from Ms. Kamiogi...

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:27.260
that you married
your teacher.

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:32.030
I want to know in detail
how you did it.

00:19:33.020 --> 00:19:34.410
I want to learn from
your experience.

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:37.130
Before that, Yagami--

00:19:37.720 --> 00:19:40.240
Do you really love Godai?

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:41.100
Yes!

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:48.980
You're just pestering him
for fun, aren't you?

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:49.960
No way.

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:51.140
You're confused.

00:19:51.230 --> 00:19:52.450
Of course not.

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:54.760
What's so good about him?

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:58.290
Is it wrong?

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:01.170
Is it wrong for me
to love Mr. Godai?

00:20:01.540 --> 00:20:03.980
N-No, it's not wrong...

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:07.530
but when I see what you do--

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:09.530
Am I doing something wrong?

00:20:10.190 --> 00:20:11.840
You're going overboard.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:13.330
Well...

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:17.080
That's why I want to know...

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:22.310
from someone who succeeded
in a student-teacher romance...

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:24.320
how I should proceed properly.

00:20:27.770 --> 00:20:29.030
It's late.

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:31.280
You have school tomorrow
don't you?

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:00.780
I can't sleep.

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:05.050
That Yagami won't go
right to sleep.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:06.430
Fine.

00:21:09.210 --> 00:21:12.290
Ms. Otonashi? HEY!

00:21:13.070 --> 00:21:15.240
I know you're still awake.

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:23.370
You're in love
with Mr. Godai.

00:21:24.030 --> 00:21:25.220
I know you are.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:26.950
That's why you
butt in all the time.

00:21:27.320 --> 00:21:29.340
When did I ever "butt in"?!

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:32.690
You wouldn't let me sleep
in Mr. Godai's room.

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:35.990
What are you saying?
I helped you out.

00:21:37.240 --> 00:21:40.500
Maybe you're still
too young to understand...

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:43.280
but Godai's a man, too.

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:45.060
W-What?

00:21:45.480 --> 00:21:48.000
And I came here, worried.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:51.040
Listen, you need self-respect.

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:52.680
Do I feel stupid.

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:54.540
I'm going to bed.

00:21:58.350 --> 00:22:00.690
Why don't we get back
to the point, Ms. Otonashi.

00:22:00.850 --> 00:22:01.980
You know--

00:22:02.770 --> 00:22:04.590
Why are you trying
to stop me?

00:22:05.130 --> 00:22:10.060
I'm the manager, so
I am responsible for--

00:22:10.710 --> 00:22:14.160
Your responsibilities include
managing your tenants' love affairs?

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:18.530
Let's make this clear.

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:21.440
Mr. Godai is in
Love with you.

00:22:24.960 --> 00:22:27.250
S-So what if he is?

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:29.040
What about you?

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:31.510
Are you in love
with Mr. Godai?

00:22:34.030 --> 00:22:35.250
Well?

00:22:35.770 --> 00:22:36.700
You love him
don't you?

00:22:39.700 --> 00:22:40.880
I--

00:22:44.440 --> 00:22:46.730
I--
N-Not really.

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:03.980
Bye!

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:05.960
Bye!

00:23:06.960 --> 00:23:09.280
Let's go!
We'll be late.

00:23:11.170 --> 00:23:13.890
Look at them.
How cute.

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:16.530
They sure are.

00:23:30.780 --> 00:23:32.690
I'm sorry, Soichiro!

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:37.910
Wait, Soichiro! Wait!

00:23:46.400 --> 00:23:48.390
Your students'
teacher evaluation?

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:50.510
"Have a nice life
with Yagami."

00:23:50.670 --> 00:23:52.040
"invite us to your wedding."

00:23:52.110 --> 00:23:53.090
Cut it out!

00:23:53.180 --> 00:23:58.600
Next: "Yagami is Determined.
I Won't Give Up My First Love!"

00:23:58.850 --> 00:24:00.640
Good evening, Mr. Godai!

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:01.950
Y-Yagami!
